# Repository context

## Upstream lineage

This library is a fork of [Comfy-Org/litegraph.js](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/litegraph.js), which is **archived**. Active development continues inside [ComfyUI_frontend](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend) at `src/lib/litegraph/`.

Treat **ComfyUI_frontend** as the alternative upstream for bug fixes and features. Many PRs from that subtree have already been ported here — check before reimplementing:

- `docs/PORTED.md` — table of ported PRs with local file mappings
- `docs/upstream-comparison.md` — gap analysis vs upstream

To port an upstream PR, use the **comfy-port** skill (`.cursor/skills/comfy-port/SKILL.md`). Do not `git cherry-pick` or merge `comfyui/main` — paths and dependencies differ.

### Path mapping (upstream → this repo)

| Upstream | This repo |
|----------|-----------|
| `src/lib/litegraph/src/**` | `src/**` |
| `src/lib/litegraph/src/**/*.test.ts` | `test/**` |
| `@/lib/litegraph/src/...` | `@/...` |

This repo is **standalone**: zero runtime dependencies, no Pinia/Vue/Comfy stores. Reimplement upstream intent in `LGraph`, `LGraphNode`, `BaseWidget`, etc. when upstream uses Comfy-only deps.

## Repository layout

```
src/                    TypeScript source (@/ alias)
  litegraph.ts          Public barrel — import from here or package root
  LGraph.ts             Graph model, serialisation, execution
  LGraphCanvas.ts       Canvas editor, input, rendering, UI
  LGraphNode.ts         Node instances, slots, widgets
  LLink.ts, Reroute.ts  Links and reroute nodes
  LiteGraphGlobal.ts    Singleton config and node-type registry
  ContextMenu.ts        DOM context menus
  canvas/               Link drag/drop (LinkConnector), render links, auto-pan
  subgraph/             Subgraph, SubgraphNode, I/O nodes, deduplication
  widgets/              Widget classes (Number, Combo, Slider, …) + widgetMap
  node/                 Input/output slots, slot utils
  infrastructure/       Rectangle, CustomEventTarget, typed event maps, errors
  types/                Shared types, enums, serialisation shapes
  utils/                Helpers (widget, uuid, mathParser, text, collections, …)
test/                   Vitest tests — mirror `src/` domains (`test/subgraph/`, …)
docs/                   PORTED.md, upstream-comparison.md, generated API (TypeDoc)
dist/                   Build output (Vite)
```

### Conventions

- **Imports**: use `@/…` in source/tests; subgraph tests import from `@/litegraph` barrel only (avoids circular deps — see `CLAUDE.md`).
- **Public API**: export new surface from `src/litegraph.ts` only when it should be public.
- **Tests**: vitest in `test/`; follow `.cursor/rules/unit-test.mdc`.
